{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15232050","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15232050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1523205001:0":{"text":"役立たずが……丸腰のメイジひとり止められんのか！あの汚らわしい野獣どもに負けるのも当然だな！","source_cn":"一群废物……竟然连一个手无寸铁的魔法师都拦不住！难怪会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3468C0A57C5F5F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1523205002:1":{"text":"次は兵士へ八つ当たりか？停戦協定が結ばれる前、彼らは満足に腹を満たすこともできなかった。そんな状態でどうやって獣人に勝てと？","source_cn":"何必指责这些无辜的士兵？在殿下签署停战合约之前，他们甚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D984A2D21E664C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523205003:1":{"text":"アバルド殿下の妥協がなければ、今もホーリン城には食料がなかった。自分の浅はかさを早く自覚するんだな。","source_cn":"如果不是阿邦德殿下暂时妥协，呼临城连如今这些食物都没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728CCAAABAC88F21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1523205004:1":{"text":"ヤクボルとの和解が、今のホーリンに残された唯一の道だ。","source_cn":"与雅库伯尔和解，是呼临当下唯一的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1794C31B38E8DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523205005:1":{"text":"停戦協定における譲渡もあくまで一時的なもの。アバルド殿下の決断がなければ、ホーリンの未来はないんだぞ！","source_cn":"停战合约中的退让只是暂时的，阿邦德殿下所做的一切都是为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ED2F4E508A347E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_ind